{"3624340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Strike and Pop", "steam_appid": 3624340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a battle as absurd as it is intense! <strong>Strike and Pop </strong>is a frenetic physics-based  arcade game where you control a puppet with a balloon head and only one goal: <strong>pop your opponent's balloon before they pop yours.</strong> To achieve this, you'll have access to different types of weapons—each sharper than the last!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/69eddb5b5691a41ee9d2ef1116b2a20b.poster.avif?t=1787161911\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/69eddb5b5691a41ee9d2ef1116b2a20b.webm?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/69eddb5b5691a41ee9d2ef1116b2a20b.mp4?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/4a4c2ae0db41ce4e6bf300ade72c54b8.poster.avif?t=1787161911\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/4a4c2ae0db41ce4e6bf300ade72c54b8.webm?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/4a4c2ae0db41ce4e6bf300ade72c54b8.mp4?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/e56f48ac037398072366dcef9b647ca5.poster.avif?t=1787161911\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/e56f48ac037398072366dcef9b647ca5.webm?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/e56f48ac037398072366dcef9b647ca5.mp4?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>fast and chaotic duels against a local player or the CPU</strong>, or test your skills in <strong>Survival mode</strong>, where each consecutive victory brings you one step closer to glory… and unlocks new, ridiculous weapons to dominate the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/40fd307eea58c77658b9305882e25339.poster.avif?t=1787161911\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/40fd307eea58c77658b9305882e25339.webm?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/40fd307eea58c77658b9305882e25339.mp4?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/69eddb5b5691a41ee9d2ef1116b2a20b.poster.avif?t=1787161911\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624340/extras/69eddb5b5691a41ee9d2ef1116b2a20b.webm?t=1787161911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st